Wait for the wallee webhook before validating the checkout session on the success page (IPET-1930), updated for wallee/magento-2 3.5.2.
Controller/Transaction/Success waits up to 5 seconds for a paid-like transaction state (AUTHORIZED, COMPLETED, FULFILL) through the injected Order\TransactionService::waitForTransactionState(), otherwise SuccessValidator::isValid() sometimes fails and the customer sees an error instead of the success page.

